OL,3,GNEWSARNLI rescues two after vessel
OL,4,Asinks near harbour
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo mariners have been rescued after
OL,7,Ftheir boat sank near the entrance to
OL,8,FLittlehampton Harbour.
OL,10,FThe Littlehampton lifeboat was called
OL,11,Fout shortly after 19:30 BST on Saturday
OL,12,Fto a 15ft (4.6m) cuddy, which was about
OL,13,F100m (328ft) south of the harbour
OL,14,Fentrance.
OL,16,FCrews said the two men were found
OL,17,Fstanding in waist-deep water after the
OL,18,Fmariners used two flares, allowing
OL,19,Frescuers to locate the sunken boat.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
