OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSARNLI rescues two after vessel
OL,4,Asinks near harbour
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe station's D-Class lifeboat, Spirit
OL,7,Fof Fidelity, took the men, who were
OL,8,F"cold but well" safely back to harbour,
OL,9,Fwhere they were met by coastguards and
OL,10,Fshore crew and taken to the lifeboat
OL,11,Fstation to warm up, the RNLI said.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
